# Copy to pass-env-map.local (gitignored) and customize.
# Format: Pass_item_title|ENV_VAR|field1[|field2|…]
# Fields are tried in order until one returns a non-empty value.
# Do NOT commit pass-env-map.local.
#
#   cp scripts/pass-env-map.example scripts/pass-env-map.local
#
# Example (placeholder titles — use your real Pass item names locally):
My API Service|MY_API_KEY|password
